    <description>Exact 1EK7A. Address 0x16056; 1 rows x 64 columns; uint16; map confidence code. Bank 2 MAF sensor transfer curve. FUN 0003a904 looks it up from the low 12 bits of bank-2 preprocessed sample ffff1e4a, writes uint16 output B to ffff1056, and copies it to working value ffff105a. The same value enters total-MAF producer 0003b27e and the paired contribution calculation in 0003b520. Exact code traces SH7058 AN15 through ffff1d64, diagnostic word ffff101e, preprocessing ffff1e4a, this curve, and total-MAF DID 0x1209. Exact DID 0x1205 names the channel MAS A/F SE-B2. The implicit code axis advances by 16 input counts per cell; homologous profiles convert one count to 0.005 V, yielding the cataloged 0.00..5.04 V axis at candidate scale. Stock outputs are strictly positive, so the contribution denominator A+B is nonzero. This branch does not produce ffff3a76. Result disposition: consumer. One count of the output is 105/25600 g/s: the bank outputs sum through ffff1df4 into ffff105c, and J1979 Mode 01 PID 0x10 declares ROM8[0x83ec]*ffff105c/256 as g/s*100 with the stock factor 105; a changed factor changes the declared conversion. Definition address projected from JK08A 000141f4 through JK08A-1EK7A.definition-addresses.csv: The target operand 00016056 at site 00047928 corresponds to the 1ME3B definition operand 00015916. Static diagnostic context: Mass Airflow Sensor Bank 2 [code, homologous_community].</description>
