  <XDFTABLE uniqueid="0xF4C2" flags="0x0">
    <title>Engine Speed Limit - Throttle Request</title>
    <description>Exact 1EK7A. Address 0x94AC; 1 rows x 1 columns; uint16; map confidence code. Base threshold and disable sentinel for the stateful signed rotational-speed request limiter. FUN 0002c648 initializes ffff1796 from this scalar. FUN 0007584e treats 0xffff as an immediate neutral return. The enabled filter converges to 4*N but uses its entry value for the 0x9424 blend and its newly stored value for the 0x9426/0x9428/0x942a request terms. Engagement requires previous signed ffff19d8 &lt; APP request ffff243c; equality takes the inactive/reset branch. Fast and normal ramp states, an independent final term, a recovery envelope with rollback, forced-neutral synchronization, and auxiliary outputs produce ffff19d8. Periodic indices 18, 20, 21, and 22 carry this candidate through signed-minimum arbitration and controller bounds to shared signed request ffff19c6. The stock-active continuous command path to ATU-II BFR6A-D continues through ffff198a, ffff183e, ffff19b2, per-channel targets ffff28bc/ffff28be, and the feedback regulator. FUN 00077892 also uses the scalar as an unsigned cap while calculating signed transmission candidate ffff4162. Common completion 000777fa can pass that candidate through ffff3480/ffff3484 only while ffff41a6.bit3 is set. The stock word is 0x2580, or 7500 RPM, between fuel-cut release 7450 RPM and activation 7650 RPM. Exact SHA-locked ROM execution covers 51 state and sweep cases and 7200..7800 RPM at four APP requests; after 20 measured 10.24 ms passes, APP 10000 yields 10000 at 7500, 7601 at 7600, 5466 at 7700, and 3086 at 7800. The secondary candidate bounds the shared request only while 00077892 holds ffff41a6.bit3 set, during a gear change with TCM field ffff3a2e == 3 and the 307.2 ms hold after it; the 2026-09-22 road captures show such episodes in 4-3 and 3-2 downshifts, so calibration-only A/B testing is isolated from that secondary path only outside them. The limiter never enters fuel mask ffff22e0. A controlled vehicle comparison of three JK08A map slots on 2026-09-21 fixes the RPM multiplier and the throttle action: slot value 0x1900 closes both throttle sensors from 369/371 to 166/171 counts from 5000 RPM under a rising pedal and holds 4915..5137 RPM, slot value 0x2580 closes them from 838 to 209/214 counts from 7466..7488 RPM with the pedal held at 4.70 V and holds 7412..7565 RPM, and slot value 0xffff leaves them at 835..837 counts until the 7650 RPM fuel cut; no limiter interval sets ffff22e0. Plate response time, channel-to-bank identity, and ECM terminals remain outside that measurement. Definition address projected from JK08A 0000942c through JK08A-1EK7A.definition-addresses.csv: The target operand 000094ac at site 00034ce0 corresponds to the 1ME3B definition operand 0000935e.</description>
