  <XDFTABLE uniqueid="0x7C90" flags="0x0">
    <title>Engine Speed Limit - Fuel Cut Curves</title>
    <description>Exact 1EK7A. Address 0x17D1E; 2 rows x 8 columns; uint16; map confidence code. Native VQ37 fuel-cut activation and release curves on the filtered raw oil-thermistor code; a lower code is a higher oil temperature. Exact 1EK7A native fuel-cut model at 0x7c890; selector 0xfffe8109, shared axis 0x17b3e. The BSR at 0007bff0 calls the first final-mask predicate, FUN_0007C890. The periodic coordinator starts at 0007be28 from task-list word 000221d8. The predicate compares the two caps and interpolated selector curves, arms bit 2, and sets bit 3 while fuel cut is active. The two rows are interpolated independently; no interpolation occurs between rows.</description>
